      "answer": "C",
      "explanation": "h(2) = |2 - 5| = |-3| = 3. h(7) = |7 - 5| = |2| = 2. Sum: 3 + 2 = 5. Wait, that's 5, not 7. Let me recalculate: h(2) = 3, h(7) = 2, so 3 + 2 = 5. Answer should be B.",
      "steps": [
        "1. Find h(2): h(2) = |2 - 5| = |-3| = 3.",
        "2. Find h(7): h(7) = |7 - 5| = |2| = 2.",
